tel 1.0 propensive.dev/bolt

# Bolt codes of Soundness: `subdivision 118` / `error 1` is ↯/s.118.1, or, by the names of each,
# ↯/soundness.stratiform.tel. A subdivision is a module, numbered so that each comes after those
# it depended on when it was numbered; a new module takes the next number. An error whose `symbol`
# is a class is that `fulminate.Error`, named for the type it belongs to; one without a name is
# reported by a macro, with `halt`. Each has a page beside this record, `<m>.<n>.md`, which
# describes its variants.
#
# This is the record of the letter `s` which the index of bolt codes, `projects.tel` in
# propensive/bolt, names; its schema is `bolt.tel` there. A code, once assigned, is permanent: a
# number is never reused, and one which is withdrawn stays, marked `retired`.

project s soundness

